th tidiness is that, in excess, it becomes rigid, fragile and sterile. In Messy, Tim Harford reveals how qualities we value more than ever – responsiveness, resilience and creativity – simply cannot be disentangled from the messy soil that produces them.\nThis, then, is a book about the benefits of being messy: messy in our private lives; messy in the office, with piles of paper on the desk and unread spreadsheets; messy in the recording studio, the laboratory or in preparing for an important presentation; and messy in our approach to business, politics and economics, leaving things vague, diverse and uncomfortably made-up-on-the-spot. It’s time to rediscover the benefits of a little mess.\n\n## Reviews\n\nViv Groskop, The Pool\n\nTim Harford's brilliant new book\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAgainst the Odds: An Autobiography Hardcover 1997 by James Dyson | eBay UK (https://www.ebay.co.uk/itm/117046676792)\nciteturn391search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; \n\nThis listing sold on Sat, 25 Jul at 8:32 PM.\n\nImage: Against the Odds: An Autobiography Hardcover 1997 by James Dyson\n\nAgainst the Odds: An Autobiography Hardcover 1997 by James Dyson Against the Odds: An Autobiography Hardcover 1997 by James Dyson\n\n£44.00£44.00\n\nincl. Buyer Protection\n\nSat, 25 Jul, 20:32 Sat, 25 Jul, 20:32\n\nSee original listing See original listing\n\n# Against the Odds: An Autobiography Hardcover 1997 by James Dyson\n\nAntiquarian Books London\n\n(6143)\n\nBusiness\n\nRegistered as a business seller\n\n100% positive\n\nSeller's other itemsSeller's other items\n\nMessage\n\n£44.00\n\nincl. Buyer Protection\n\nCondition:\n\nGood Good\n\n“Good book, some edge wear to DJ, foxing to page edges, previous owners name to front endpaper, SEE ”... Read moreAbout condition\n\n## Postage, returns and payments\n\nPostage:\n\n£29.45 Royal Mail International Tracked. See details for postage\n\nLocated in: London, United Kingdom\n\nDe